# ===== Saídas / artefatos =====
reports/figures/*
!reports/figures/.gitkeep
*.png
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.mp4
*.avi
*.wav
*.mp3
*.pkl
*.joblib
*.h5
*.pt
*.pth
